# "?" Assignment 4 "?" Group11 - autoencoder + PCA pipeline (Group 11)
# Everything below is REGENERATED by run_all.py in ~4.5 minutes on the RTX 2050,
# so none of it belongs in version control. The global patterns above (*.json,
# *.pt, *.png, *.pdf) already cover the files; these entries make the intent
# explicit and catch anything that slips through.

# Run artefacts: checkpoints, logs, status snapshots, per-task JSON, figures.
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/results_final/
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/results_*/
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/logs/
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/pilot_findings.json

# Pre-rerun comparison snapshot (created only to verify reproducibility).
Assignment4/_baseline_snapshot/

# Stray result files at the CODE ROOT, not inside a run directory.
# run_all.py only ever writes these into <outdir>/. Copies sitting beside the
# source are leftovers from an earlier ad-hoc run and go stale the moment a new
# run finishes - an independent audit read the root copy instead of
# results_final/ and quoted a superseded run's numbers. Ignore them, and delete
# the existing ones so the next reader cannot repeat that.
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/summary.json
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/selection.json

# LaTeX report: the .tex SOURCES are tracked (they are the source of truth); the
# compiled PDFs and every build artefact are not. The PDFs are delivered through
# Moodle, not through git, and are rebuilt with: pdflatex report.tex
#
# Two .tex files by design. main.tex is the template and keeps its \RESULT
# placeholders so a future run can be dropped back into it; report.tex is the
# filled, corrected version that compiles to report.pdf and is what is submitted.
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/main.pdf
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/report.pdf
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.aux
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.log
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.out
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.toc
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.lof

# Submission archives (uploaded to Moodle as a zip, never committed).
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code.zip
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_report.pdf
